      "title": "check_typed_item_calls.py: check for value_string conflicts",
      "message": "check_typed_item_calls.py: check for value_string conflicts\n\nThis check is similar to what is done in proto.c, but there\nit is only applied if the value_string is used by a registering\nheader field - the issues fixed here are not used in that way.\n",
